{"page":38,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:234","surah":2,"ayah":234,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُتَوَفَّوْنَ مِنكُمْ وَيَذَرُونَ أَزْوَٰجًا يَتَرَبَّصْنَ بِأَنفُسِهِنَّ أَرْبَعَةَ أَشْهُرٍ وَعَشْرًا ۖ فَإِذَا بَلَغْنَ أَجَلَهُنَّ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِيمَا فَعَلْنَ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِنَّ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If any of you die and leave widows, the widows should wait for four months and ten nights before remarrying. When they have completed this set time, you will not be blamed for anything they may reasonably choose to do with themselves. God is fully aware of what you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُتَوَفَّوْنَ","en_gloss":"pass away","transliteration":"yutawaffawna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَيَذَرُونَ","en_gloss":"and leave behind","transliteration":"wayadharūna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en_gloss":"wives","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَتَرَبَّصْنَ","en_gloss":"(the widows) should wait","transliteration":"yatarabbaṣna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِأَنفُسِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"for themselves","transliteration":"bi-anfusihinna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَرْبَعَةَ","en_gloss":"(for) four","transliteration":"arbaʿata","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَشْهُرٍۢ","en_gloss":"months","transliteration":"ashhurin","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَعَشْرًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"and ten (days)","transliteration":"waʿashran","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَلَغْنَ","en_gloss":"they reach","transliteration":"balaghna","verse_key":"2:234"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَجَلَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"their (specified) term","transliteration":"ajalahunna",