t with them; speak to them honourably and do not confirm the marriage tie until the prescribed period reaches its end. Remember that God knows what is in your souls, so be mindful of Him. Remember that God is most forgiving and forbearing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (there is) no","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"blame","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَرَّضْتُم","en_gloss":"you hint","transliteration":"ʿarraḍtum","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[with it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خِطْبَةِ","en_gloss":"marriage proposal","transliteration":"khiṭ'bati","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"[to] the women","transliteration":"l-nisāi","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَكْنَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you conceal it","transliteration":"aknantum","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلِمَ","en_gloss":"Knows","transliteration":"ʿalima","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"that you","transliteration":"annakum","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":17,"ar":"سَتَذْكُرُونَهُنَّ","en_gloss":"will mention them","transliteration":"satadhkurūnahunna","verse_key":"2:235"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"[and] but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"2:235"},{"p